  "interpretation": "TCGA-LIHC paired tissue contrast is dominated by HCC etiology, not by fibrosis grade or stage. Viral hepatitis raises the adjacent-normal A-score baseline through chronic inflammation-driven methylation drift, shrinking the paired tumor-vs-normal contrast. Non-viral HCC (alcohol/NAFLD/none) shows classical secretory-class tissue arm magnitude (d=+0.66, comparable to VAL-060 breast +0.68). The pooled VAL-064 d=+0.498 reflects the cohort's mixed etiology composition."
